  "steps": [
    "Cut the two end frames and the back frame from cedar, then screw them into a U shape.",
    "Build the seat frame and hinge it to the back so it lifts from the front.",
    "Cut the seat slats and screw them to the lifting frame, then screw on the storage liner.",
    "Screw the back slats in place and cap the top arms.",
    "Fit the stays so the seat props open, then sand and seal the whole bench twice."
